{"version":1,"id":"panic-at-the-disco-death-of-a-bachelor","title":"Death Of A Bachelor","artist":"Panic! At The Disco","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/panic-at-the-disco/death-of-a-bachelor/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Brendon Urie, Lolo and Jacob Sinclair","chords":[{"symbol":"Dm","canonical":"Dm","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,5,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Fm","canonical":"Fm","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Do I look lonely? I see the shadows on my face","columns":46,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":28,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"People have told me, I don't look the same","columns":42,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":21,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe I lost weight, I'm playing hooky","columns":38,"beats":7,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":20,"beat":1},{"symbol":"C","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"With the best of the best, put your heart on my chest so that you can see it too","columns":80,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":48,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":74,"beat":5}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm walking the long road, watching the sky fall","columns":52,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":40,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Am","column":50,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"The lace in your dress tangles my neck, how do I live?","columns":54,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G","column":47,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"The death of a bachelor, oh oh oh, letting the water fall","columns":57,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":1},{"symbol":"F","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":47,"beat":3},{"symbol":"C","column":53,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"The death of a bachelor, oh oh oh, seems so fitting for","columns":55,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":1},{"symbol":"F","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":44,"beat":3},{"symbol":"C","column":52,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Happily ever after, ooh, how could I ask for more?","columns":50,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":20,"beat":1},{"symbol":"F","column":24,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":37,"beat":3},{"symbol":"C","column":45,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"A lifetime of laughter at the expense of the death of a bachelor","columns":64,"beats":14,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":23,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":45,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Fm","column":56,"beat":6},{"symbol":"C","column":62,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm cutting my mind off, It feel like my heart is going to burst","columns":64,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":23,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":41,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Alone at a table for two and I just wanna be served","columns":51,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":29,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":45,"beat":5}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And when you think of me, am I the best you've ever had?","columns":56,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":24,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":35,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Am","column":52,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Share one more drink with me, smile even though you're sad","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":55,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm walking the long road, watching the sky fall","columns":52,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C","column":40,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Am","column":50,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"The lace in your dress tangles my neck, how do I live?","columns":54,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G","column":47,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"The death of a bachelor, oh oh oh, letting the water fall","columns":57,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":34,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Fm","column":47,"beat":6},{"symbol":"C","column":53,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"The death of a bachelor, oh oh oh, seems so fitting for","columns":55,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":34,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Fm","column":44,"beat":6},{"symbol":"C","column":52,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Happily ever after, ooh, how could I ask for more?","colum